learnings:
  - The CSP (style-src 'self') silently drops inline style attributes; a GUI module that set style= never rendered as designed. Test visible output, not just DOM structure.
  - 'Dogfooding found the speaker regression within minutes, where 2400 unit tests did not: voice needs an end-to-end real-model regression test.'
